                                                "sense_id": "923337a2-aebd-39a1-b975-93b27daceaf8",
                                                "text": "For months Travis had seen his solitary figure, shoulders hunched inside the flying jacket, in more and more newsreels, as an extra in war films, and then as a patient in an elegant ophthalmic film on nystagmus"
                                            }
